gad7(){return"Choose \u201cStop sync on this device\u201d."},
gad8(){return"Once no device syncs anymore, the relay erases the encrypted copy after 180 days. It cannot read it and does not know who it belongs to."},
gad0(){return"Your account"},
gacX(){return"If you have an account, delete it in the app (Account and sync, Delete my account) or at app.mirinu.ch/#/supprimer, without installing the app. Your account, your email address and your encrypted library are erased from the relay 7 days after your request; until then, you can cancel. From a linked device, \u201cDelete right away\u201d erases them without waiting. \u201cKeep sync without an account\u201d deletes the account and leaves sync between your devices. The relay's backups keep what is erased for up to 7 more days. What is on your devices stays there."},
gad3(){return"A question"},
