gahf(){return"If you share your profile, stop sharing in the app (Share my profile, Stop sharing): the page is erased from the relay as soon as the app reaches it. Deleting your account from the app also stops sharing. Without the app, write to contact@mirinu.ch with the link. Otherwise, it is erased 180 days after its last update."},
